      "Section 2 defines a personal data breach as any unauthorised processing of personal data or accidental disclosure, acquisition, sharing, use, alteration, destruction, or loss of access to personal data, that compromises the confidentiality, integrity, or availability of personal data. That definition has been in force since 13 November 2025. You can use it on the review date to classify an incident. The duty to prevent breaches by reasonable security safeguards, and the duty to give intimation, are in section 8 and commence on 13 May 2027.",
